## getSubscriptionStatus / verifyPurchase → subscription Lambda
{
  "version": "2018-05-29",
  "operation": "Invoke",
  "payload": {
    "userId":    $util.toJson($context.identity.sub),
    "operation": $util.toJson($context.info.fieldName),
    "input":     $util.toJson($util.defaultIfNull($context.arguments.input, {}))
  }
}
